105 | - Global actual returned datetime range before regional filtering:
106 |   - `2025-06-01 00:03:37.790000` to `2026-05-01 23:58:44.740000`
107 | - Global retained Sanriku datetime range:
108 |   - `2025-06-01 00:09:02.360000` to `2026-05-01 23:58:44.740000`
109 | 
110 | The first chunk covered `2025-06-01` to `2025-06-08` exclusive and submitted an inclusive service end date of `2025-06-07`. It parsed 5,359 rows and retained 502 Sanriku rows.
111 | 
112 | The final chunk covered `2026-04-26` to `2026-05-02` exclusive and submitted an inclusive service end date of `2026-05-01`. It parsed 5,328 rows and retained 1,543 Sanriku rows.
113 | 
